  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/budcribar/RemoteBlazorWebView",
  "published": "2026-11-11T23:34:24.203Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Based on maui 11.0.0\n\nChanges since 11.0.0-rc2\nMerge branch 'claude/net11-port-shared-control': net10's shared control work on the released .NET 11 (11.0.0)\nnet11: no pack hook or package reference that net11 had already removed\nRelease process doc: net11 numbers and how EditWebView runs on this line\nUpstream source from aspnetcore 11.0.0 and MAUI 11.0.10 (EditWebView run)\nnet11: keep net11's own module-initializer end-to-end tests\nnet11: the ported cache test passes the cache-control value net11's helper needs\nnet11 on the released .NET 11: SDK 11.0.100, packages 11.0.0, version 11.0.0\nPort net10 since the last sync: shared control, owner key, sign-in providers, opt-in session bar\nDocument EditWebView in the release process.\nMerge pull request #80 from budcribar/claude/net11-escape-release-notes\nEscape commas and semicolons in the release notes passed to dotnet pack\nMerge pull request #77 from budcribar/claude/net11-port-net10-release\nRetarget the ported net10 projects to net11\nPrepare NuGet release packaging, CI test coverage, and remote component contract hardening\nRemoteComponentHost: ExitWhenInputCloses, exit when stdin ends instead of polling\nKeep remote component frames from restarting when the app is mirrored\nMark agent registry (AgentHub/AgentAdmin) experimental (RWV001)\nRestore Authorization package references in RemoteWebViewService.Lib\nDescribe agents and the embedded relay without naming one app\nRemote components README: use a generic contract example\nRemote components: describe the use generically\nAdd the [RemoteComponentContract] source generator\nAdd remote components: runtime and the WPF RemoteComponentHost\nAdd ReverseMirror to [RemoteBlazor]\nAdd the [RemoteBlazor] source generator\nPort the net9 test-runner and window-sizing fixes.\nInstall nvm-windows when RunTests.ps1 cannot find nvm.\nThrow the frame-ancestor error after the scan.\nName the first invalid frame ancestor after valid ones.\nMerge pull request #66 from budcribar/net11-bugbounty-fixes\nPort Bug02, Bug03 (dispose-on-throw), Bug06, Bug15, Bug44, and Bug60 fixes and regression tests\nPin net11 to the rc.3 SDK and the patched Graph/Kiota line.\nUpdate net11 dependencies to current rc.3 and stable releases.\nPin global.json to the SDK shipped by the 11.0-preview image.\nFix Sonar reliability and security findings that are safe to backport.\nMerge pull request #65 from budcribar/claude/net11-port-net10\nTarget net11 in the ported embedded-relay library, sample and server branch CI\nLet pages in opaque-origin sandboxed iframes connect\nSynchronize primary browser scrolling to read-only mirrors\nEmbeddedRelayWpf: embed wwwroot so a single-file publish works\nEmbeddedRelayWpf: target Windows 10 SDK and show crashes\nCopy RemoteWebViewService.Lib into the Docker build and server CI paths\nSplit RemoteWebViewService into an embeddable library for net10\nGate AgentAdmin starts with AGENT_ADMIN_KEY and guard in-flight starts\nAdd the agent registry (AgentHub / AgentAdmin) to RemoteWebViewService\nAdd Linux container mode with Kestrel TLS/HTTP2 for Railway TCP proxy.\nRemove net10-only Program.IsContainerMode reference from Startup.cs on net11\nAdd in-memory event log provider for GetLoggedEvents on Linux\nFail the performance check when the baseline has no samples.\nAdd the net11 intermittent CI failure log.\nRecord the nuget.org user and required reviewer.\nGenerate PackageReleaseNotes for the maintainer to commit.\nSpell package suffixes without a dot and add a patch counter.\nDraft the package release workflow without a NuGet push.\nAdd a draft release workflow skeleton.\nRead Chrome output on a dedicated thread before waiting for DevTools.\nRetry a timed-out DevTools probe and keep the Chrome module classes in one collection.\nMeasure TestConnectedEvent from the Connected signal, not the pause.\nNote SYSLIB1044 on the base-href regex as won't fix.\n\nFull list: https://github.com/budcribar/RemoteBlazorWebView/compare/11.0.0-rc2...24c67bf600e845754a3edfc138ccc97c6f2ccb00",
